  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I would like to see the existing OSC Menu to be migrated over to the Debug Menu. I believe the new framework would allow for better readability, easier debugging, and improved filtering of the display. \n\nI believe this will solve:\n\n- Consistent location for debugging (one panel vs two)\n\n- Refresh the UI to not be a terminal experience\n\n- Improve user readability\n\n- Improve the VR and Desktop experience\n\n- Improve Branding consistency by adopting new debug theming/design\n\nI would like to see: \n\n- Filtering/Searching of different data types depending on the context. (Int,Bool,Float) \n\n- Option to switch to the display to/from Graph and Table mode. Table mode only showing the current value.\n\n- Be able to see attached clients, port, the requests/sec, and possibly a toggle to see what endpoints they are calling. \n\n- See what OSC endpoints are exposed on my avatar who is altering that data. \n\n- Also potentially a log to mark transactions between applications. \n\nI've attached an example of what I roughly conceptualize for this type of menu.",
